---
/** '없는 주소' 본문 — 정적 404 페이지와 옛 주소 처리 페이지([...legacy].astro)가 같이 쓴다 */
---
<section class="pt-14 pb-16 md:pt-20">
  <div class="container-page max-w-xl! text-center">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold">We couldn't find that page</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-muted">The link may be broken, or the page was moved.</p>
    <p lang="ko" class="mt-4 font-semibold">페이지를 찾을 수 없어요</p>
    <p lang="ko" class="text-sm text-muted">주소가 바뀌었거나 잘못 입력되었을 수 있어요.</p>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
      <a href="/" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-full bg-brand px-5 font-semibold text-white hover:bg-[#082D6B]">Browse routes</a>
      <a href="/partner" lang="ko" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-full border border-border bg-surface px-5 font-semibold hover:border-text">지기 홈</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
